{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0b028bf94df6aa1115fee7f1ea3909c80396c6c5396edef53b19eff1a56deb31", "ja": "（『魔法学園』シリーズでは、先生役を務める桃子。\nこれから、作中で着る衣装のフィッティングだ）", "zh": "（在《魔法学园》系列中担任教师角色的桃子。接下来要试穿剧中服装。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "653f3d6d1576280f089080c4e38bfefef46ba87633f0a6035edaf77261519c4c", "ja": "わあ……。魔法使いの先生の服だから、\nシンプルなのかなって思ったけど。面白いね。", "zh": "哇……我还以为魔法使老师的服装会比较简单，没想到还挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "4ba03c6b7934c48994190af803f2330e189a908b057b9142f78a36c02a3880d2", "ja": "ブーツも、左右で長さが違ってる。……まさか、\nお兄ちゃんがオーダーミスしたわけじゃないよね？", "zh": "靴靴的长度左右也不一样。……该不会是哥哥下单弄错了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bbf122d035aca18edd75629c9851b2b7b1b3b534257db04dfe89b30c9707dfab", "ja": "大丈夫、してないよ。", "zh": "放心吧，我没弄错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1004_p", "source_sha256": "74c1f2ce605432bb6ecb7b6c61db223400af55e03c54f80864d6173fcd6f1078", "ja": "今回の衣装は、『魔法学園』の世界観や\nキャラクター性をデザインに落とし込んでいるそうだ。", "zh": "听说这次的服装将《魔法学园》的世界观和角色特性融入了设计之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "8b915be1bfe636df4a7e2575f56b4c52698f3c7dbf7e2919a99c5e9e12660f86", "ja": "ならいいんだけど。\nでも、キャラクター性かぁ……。", "zh": "那就好。\n不过，角色个性啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c2bbfe155d5de3c4f87bbed3c359cfaaf524a501d0ed62ca3e2a11147bca76dd", "ja": "『桃子先生』の能力は、確か変身だったな。", "zh": "“桃子老师”的能力，我记得是变身吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "493d29b6ccbfcca250e617beb2ae8f4011eea7d357b0ead7c2a4da56d85fb396", "ja": "そうだよ。魔法で、どんなものにも\n姿を変えられちゃうなんて、面白いよね♪", "zh": "没错。用魔法变成任何东西，想想就觉得很有意思吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6b4f2cfb8d7fad432ec7f8b904c2406a7468bef94262788f2d48c3b093629a7e", "ja": "そうだな。もし、本当に変身魔法が\n使えたとしたら、桃子は何になってみたい？", "zh": "是啊。要是真的会变身魔法的话，桃子想变成什么试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "74e0ecb9846b74361d2a041cd59e576733f25e88ff276132a6d51ad402076f6e", "ja": "変身できたら？　……うーん。\n動物とか、鳥とかも楽しそうだけど……。", "zh": "要是能变身的话？……嗯——\n变成动物啊、鸟什么的好像也挺好玩的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "816a6c259ae1b92238f3674e74a57e5f6f57183c5b04f80382d149b63a2bb09a", "ja": "でも桃子は、大人になってみたいかも？", "zh": "不过桃子……或许想变成大人看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1011_p", "source_sha256": "34f83bb801a637ee2036524e3f2a0261cda9704e274a2d687468e00e7ef80db1", "ja": "大人か……。急がなくても、あと何年かしたら\n大人になっちゃうんだけどな。", "zh": "大人吗……就算不用着急，再过几年\n也会变成大人就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "4aa6f92c2eeb2d9ef5296c36684b5b13aa50aa59a2f49ea5e1ab52836401196a", "ja": "もう、そういう夢のないこと言わないの！\nちょっと見てみたいだけなんだから、いいでしょ？", "zh": "真是的，别说这种不解风情的话啦！\n桃子只是想稍微看一眼而已，有什么不好的嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "23ceed319d3fbb3056be030c4e0279adaf8db3a1e18eb1cf76eea3d792315cb6", "ja": "……そうだ。ねえ、お兄ちゃん。もしも桃子が\n大人になったとしたら、どんな衣装が似合うと思う？", "zh": "……对了。呐，大哥哥。要是桃子\n变成大人的话，你觉得桃子穿什么样的服装会合适？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7e12a1b91e49af4ac8c9c2e8273c55f88d21af86d874de38cf047aa8b2b44fb0", "ja": "魔法で大人にか？　そうだな……。\nアイドルらしく、可愛い衣装とか……？", "zh": "用魔法变成大人吗？这个嘛……。像偶像一样，穿可爱的服装之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f4db65191e15e71e48c8abf0aa67ef6b7423f7fd9491f0d6a959b9859a3c0ecb", "ja": "いや、すごく大人っぽくなるかもしれないか。\nキレイ系……意外とシックな方向なんかも……。", "zh": "不，也可能会变得非常有大人味吗。\n美丽成熟的路线……意外地走典雅沉稳风格好像也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "9cde8ae83692481dee17fe7af9e8595c9638b144bb5fee3d9f048cb81ed70f6a", "ja": "もう！\nお兄ちゃん、独り言ばっかり言ってないで！", "zh": "真是的！\n大哥哥，别光顾着自言自语啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "be7f97d324d6fab9f89d4a34b096b2d0a94cf1e4a33bd341f09fdaa53be7b2cc", "ja": "ちょっと聞いただけなのに、そんなに迷うなんて……\n桃子の魅力、ちゃんとわかってないんじゃない？", "zh": "只是问了你一点点，居然还要犹豫这么久……你根本没好好理解桃子的魅力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fba9634244ae469e598184e253225ee6568681581a0b32a3d254e0b3d3c14fd9", "ja": "そ、そうじゃないんだ！　桃子の魅力と可能性を\n考えたら、どれかひとつに絞れなくて……。", "zh": "不、不是那样的！一想到桃子的魅力和可能性，\n我就没办法只选一个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "45ad7a2c9764652589269ebf175be13d8ff392ca6aeb00c72e746de37dfadedd", "ja": "……ふ、ふーん。そうなんだ。\nそれなら別にいいけど……。", "zh": "……唔、嗯——这样啊。那样的话，倒也没关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1020_p", "source_sha256": "08ff4412797a059c1c9919fe897d19e23af1f43d90bcfa7f541667dc32e4a8de", "ja": "ああ。今だって、桃子の魅力はひとつじゃないし……\nどんな衣装がいいか、ひとつに決めるのは難しいな。", "zh": "啊。就算是现在，桃子的魅力也不止一个方面……\n要决定哪一套服装好，确实很难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "ea6a6e871ccbade4376ae1a8a5ec56bc0dfe92cbf8137f8c0096d5cf12dc9096", "ja": "そうなんだ。\n……お兄ちゃんはわかりやすいのにね。", "zh": "这样啊。\n……明明哥哥就很好懂嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1022_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "19184d00bae11cfba68bf82bf7d545632a3177d5e85cbb8037a40779f91311a0", "ja": "うん。桃子が何回魔法をかけても、\nお兄ちゃんはスーツ着てそう。そんな気がする！", "zh": "嗯。感觉不管桃子施多少次魔法，\n大哥哥都还是会穿着西装。桃子有这种感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b8ff1b40f02ff914a716569e97beda14f5fb7e6f08e312c45e4c8633f5b85efc", "ja": "うっ……。\n何も言い返せないな。俺も桃子と同じ意見だよ。", "zh": "呜……。\n真是无从反驳。我也和桃子意见一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "def4e470156d682a862f991bd0f5420566971c4ca96a9746974f5a1a19d874ae", "ja": "別にいいんじゃない？　他の服を着たお兄ちゃんは、\nあんまり想像できないし……。", "zh": "这样也没什么不好吧？穿着其他衣服的哥哥，我也不太能想象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0734_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0734_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "4502b78921a49c3b5767fa78dd73317f1e2b2c0eef49f1c58a4a65cfb4ae31cd", "ja": "それに、スーツも嫌いじゃないしね！\nずっとそのままでいてよね、お兄ちゃん。ふふっ♪", "zh": "而且，我也不讨厌西装嘛！\n哥哥，你要一直保持这个样子哦。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
